    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Same five bands, same order, one step further along the wheel. (One reminder: the ladder marks roots only — there's no "
        },
        {
          "text": "b3",
          "marks": ["code"]
        },
        {
          "text": " to find on it.)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The chords transpose with the ladder too, and that's the payoff."
